category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgmp10 liblapack0
sdesc: "Integer Matrix Library (runtime)"
ldesc: "IML is a free library of C source code which implements algorithms for
computing exact solutions to dense systems of linear equations over the
integers. IML is designed to be compiled with a CBLAS library
(e.g., ATLAS/BLAS) and the GMP bignum library."
external-source: iml

